The derived code has been substantially simplified and modified for the
standalone fontfix project.

This project embeds Adobe's Adobe-GB1 character collection data:

Adobe-GB1 CID-to-Unicode table
Copyright 1990-2018 Adobe Systems Incorporated.

The table in adobe_gb1_data.go is generated from Adobe's Adobe-GB1
CID-to-Unicode mapping as redistributed by poppler-data
(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/poppler/poppler-data). It is used to resolve a
PDF CID to a character when a CID-keyed font provides no ToUnicode CMap, which
is the only remaining authority for what the CID means.

